ail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-105.94,"default_fair_val":-105.94,"premium_pct":-278.7,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":16.9,"pe_forward":14.9,"pb_trailing":2.4,"pb_forward":2.2,"div_yield":1.43,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":1.37,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":79.5,"cash_to_assets":2.3,"current_ratio":2.13,"roe":14,"roa":2.3,"moat":{"ticker":"GATX","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"GATX 的品牌在鐵路貨運租賃領域具有一定的知名度，但其產品本質上是商品化的服務，客戶選擇供應商時，價格和可用性是主要考量因素，而非品牌忠誠度。與消費品品牌不同，GATX 的品牌價值無法直接轉化為顯著的定價權。雖然公司在行業內營運多年，累積了信譽，但面對眾多競爭者，其品牌優勢並不足以支撐顯著溢價，因此在品牌定價權方面得分中等。","comment_en":"GATX's brand has some recognition in the railcar leasing sector, but its services are essentially commoditized. Customers primarily consider price and availability when choosing suppliers, rather than brand loyalty. Unlike consumer brands, GATX's brand value cannot directly translate into significant pricing power. While the company has operated for many years and built a reputation, its brand advantage is not sufficient to command a substantial premium against numerous competitors, hence the moderate score for brand pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"GATX 的核心業務是鐵路貨運車輛的租賃，這是一個高度依賴實物資產和營運效率的行業，而非技術創新。該行業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本投入和營運經驗，而非專利或特許經營權。GATX 並不依賴專利來保護其業務，也沒有受到政府的特許經營權保護。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，GATX 的得分極低。","comment_en":"GATX's core business is the leasing of rail freight cars, an industry heavily reliant on physical assets and operational efficiency rather than technological innovation. Entry barriers in this sector stem primarily from capital investment and operational experience, not patents or regulatory franchises. GATX does not rely on patents to protect its business, nor is it protected by government-granted franchises. Therefore, GATX scores very low on patents and regulatory barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於租賃鐵路貨運車輛的客戶而言，更換供應商的轉換成本相對較高。這主要體現在需要重新評估和談判租賃合約，以及潛在的物流中斷風險。雖然客戶可以選擇不同的供應商，但大規模的運輸需求往往需要長期穩定的供應鏈，這使得頻繁更換租賃夥伴變得不切實際。GATX 的長期租賃合約和客戶關係，構成了中等偏上的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"For customers leasing rail freight cars, the switching costs to change suppliers are relatively high. This is mainly reflected in the need to re-evaluate and renegotiate lease agreements, as well as the potential risk of logistical disruptions. While customers can choose different suppliers, large-scale transportation needs often require stable, long-term supply chains, making frequent changes in leasing partners impractical. GATX's long-term lease agreements and customer relationships constitute a moderate-to-high switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"GATX 的鐵路貨運租賃業務不具備顯著的網絡效應。網絡效應通常發生在平台型業務中，例如社交媒體或市場，用戶越多，價值越大。在車輛租賃領域，客戶的選擇主要基於車輛的可用性、價格和服務質量，而非其他用戶的存在。GATX 的業務模式不依賴於用戶網絡的增長來提升其價值，因此在網絡效應方面得分很低。","comment_en":"GATX's railcar leasing business does not exhibit significant network effects. Network effects typically occur in platform-based businesses, such as social media or marketplaces, where more users lead to greater value. In the car leasing sector, customer choices are primarily based on vehicle availability, price, and service quality, not the presence of other users. GATX's business model does not rely on the growth of a user network to enhance its value, thus scoring very low on network effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GATX 作為全球領先的鐵路貨運車輛租賃公司之一，其龐大的車隊規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。公司能夠以更低的單位成本採購、維護和管理大量車輛。規模經濟不僅體現在採購議價能力上，也包括營運效率的提升和風險分散。這種規模優勢使得新進入者難以在成本上與 GATX 競爭，構成了強大的護城河。","comment_en":"As one of the world's leading railcar leasing companies, GATX's vast fleet size provides a significant cost advantage. The company can procure, maintain, and manage a large number of railcars at a lower unit cost. Economies of scale are evident not only in purchasing power but also in improved operational efficiency and risk diversification. This scale advantage makes it difficult for new entrants to compete with GATX on cost, forming a strong moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"GATX 在全球範圍內擁有廣泛的車隊和營運網絡，尤其在北美市場佔有重要地位。雖然鐵路貨運車輛本身並非獨特的地理資產，但 GATX 在關鍵市場的佈局、與主要鐵路公司的長期合作關係，以及其遍布各地的維修網絡，共同構成了一種難以複製的地理優勢。這種廣泛的網絡和市場滲透率，為其業務提供了穩固的基礎。","comment_en":"GATX possesses an extensive fleet and operational network globally, holding a significant position particularly in the North American market. While railcars themselves are not unique geographical assets, GATX's presence in key markets, long-standing relationships with major railroad companies, and its widespread maintenance network collectively form a difficult-to-replicate geographical advantage. This broad network and market penetration provide a solid foundation for its business."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GATX 在車輛的採購、維護、調度和租賃管理方面展現出高度的營運效率。公司透過精細化的管理和技術應用，最大化車輛的使用率，同時控制維護成本。其豐富的行業經驗和專業知識，使其能夠有效應對複雜的物流需求和市場變化。這種卓越的營運能力是其核心競爭力之一，也是重要的護城河。","comment_en":"GATX demonstrates high operational efficiency in the procurement, maintenance, deployment, and lease management of its railcars. Through meticulous management and technological applications, the company maximizes fleet utilization while controlling maintenance costs. Its extensive industry experience and expertise enable it to effectively respond to complex logistics demands and market changes. This superior operational capability is one of its core competencies and a significant moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"GATX 在資本配置方面表現穩健，歷史上能夠在維持車隊擴張和更新的同時，為股東帶來穩定的回報。公司透過精準的市場判斷和審慎的投資決策，優化其資產組合，並適時進行股票回購和股息發放。雖然其資產負債表顯示較高的負債水平，但其強勁的自由現金流支持了其資本配置策略的有效性，展現了良好的管理層能力。","comment_en":"GATX exhibits a solid track record in capital allocation, historically managing to provide stable returns to shareholders while maintaining fleet expansion and renewal. The company optimizes its asset portfolio through precise market judgment and prudent investment decisions, and engages in timely share buybacks and dividend distributions. Although its balance sheet shows a relatively high debt level, its strong free cash flow supports the effectiveness of its capital allocation strategy, demonstrating good management capabilities."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"GATX 的客戶留存率相對較高，這得益於其長期租賃合約、可靠的服務以及與客戶建立的穩固關係。一旦客戶與 GATX 簽訂長期租賃協議，並將其運輸物流與 GATX 的車隊緊密結合，轉換成本和潛在的營運中斷風險會促使客戶傾向於續約。公司透過持續提供高質量的服務和靈活的解決方案，維持了客戶的忠誠度。","comment_en":"GATX enjoys relatively high customer retention rates, attributable to its long-term lease agreements, reliable services, and strong relationships built with clients. Once customers enter into long-term lease agreements with GATX and integrate their transportation logistics with GATX's fleet, the switching costs and potential operational disruption risks encourage them to renew their contracts. The company maintains customer loyalty by consistently providing high-quality services and flexible solutions."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"GATX 的業務模式具有相當的持久性。鐵路貨運作為基礎設施的一部分，其需求相對穩定，不易受到短期經濟波動的劇烈影響。公司擁有的龐大且不斷更新的車隊，以及其在行業內的長期營運經驗，使其能夠抵禦市場的周期性波動。儘管面臨潛在的技術變革（如自動駕駛或替代能源），但鐵路運輸的本質需求和 GATX 的適應能力，使其護城河具有較好的持久性。","comment_en":"GATX's business model possesses considerable durability. Rail freight, as part of essential infrastructure, has relatively stable demand and is not severely affected by short-term economic fluctuations. The company's large and continuously updated fleet, along with its long-term operational experience in the industry, enables it to withstand cyclical market swings. Despite potential technological changes (such as autonomous driving or alternative energy), the fundamental demand for rail transport and GATX's adaptability suggest its moat has good durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"GATX 的護城河主要建立在其龐大的規模經濟、卓越的營運效率以及相對較高的客戶轉換成本之上。作為一家領先的鐵路貨運車輛租賃公司，其廣泛的車隊和全球佈局構成了顯著的成本優勢和市場滲透力。儘管品牌和網絡效應較弱，但其穩健的資本配置和客戶留存能力，使其業務模式具備相當的持久性。GATX 的業務模式可被視為一種「收費橋」的變體，為客戶提供關鍵的運輸基礎設施服務，並從中收取租金，其護城河相對堅固。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"GATX's moat is primarily built upon its substantial economies of scale, excellent operational efficiency, and relatively high customer switching costs. As a leading railcar leasing company, its extensive fleet and global presence provide significant cost advantages and market penetration. Although brand and network effects are weaker, its solid capital allocation and customer retention capabilities lend considerable durability to its business model. GATX's business can be viewed as a variation of a 'toll bridge,' providing essential transportation infrastructure services to customers for a fee, with a relatively strong moat.","evidenceHash":"42f9500529440db3db5f6ca1e72c030bce139f28e33a4f77d8b408703d24cf9c","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":"staleEvidence","evidenceHash":"42f9500529440db3db5f6ca1e72c030bce139f28e33a4f77d8b408703d24cf9c","currentEvidenceHash":"b1b718d19d934054c6d6b3c19978acf12829e8882df925708bbdfe0d5f01fd89"},"fScore":{"score":4,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:50:24.633Z","evidenceHash":"93935d7b5f87b36a6ea27ac1f40bb17ea27f7b3cf17291948190d925dbe65743"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:50:24.633Z","evidenceHash":"93935d7b5f87b36a6ea27ac1f40bb17ea27f7b3cf17291948190d925dbe65743"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GATX.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GATX.png","website":"https://www.gatx.com","ceo":"Robert C. Lyons","full_time_employees":"2371","description":"GATX Corporation, established in Chicago, Illinois in 1898, is a prominent global equipment lessor. The company primarily provides railcar and locomotive leasing services across North America and internationally, catering to vital industries such as petroleum, chemicals, food/agriculture, and transportation. Its operational framework is divided into three key segments: Rail North America, Rail International, and Portfolio Management. Beyond simply supplying equipment, GATX offers a comprehensive suite of support and maintenance services for its rail fleet. These include interior cleaning, routine upkeep and repairs to car bodies and safety features, ensuring regulatory compliance, facilitating wheelset replacements, performing interior blasting and lining, exterior painting, and applying car stenciling. Furthermore, GATX's activities extend to leasing aircraft spare engines (including units it directly owns) and managing a small collection of five liquefied gas-carrying vessels. The company also applies its expertise to overseeing asset portfolios on behalf of third parties. GATX maintains a substantial asset base, comprising approximately 147,000 railcars, a combined fleet of 568 locomotives (539 four-axle and 29 six-axle), and its five specialized vessels.","description_en":"GATX Corporation, established in Chicago, Illinois in 1898, is a prominent global equipment lessor. The company primarily provides railcar and locomotive leasing services across North America and internationally, catering to vital industries such as petroleum, chemicals, food/agriculture, and transportation. Its operational framework is divided into three key segments: Rail North America, Rail International, and Portfolio Management. Beyond simply supplying equipment, GATX offers a comprehensive suite of support and maintenance services for its rail fleet. These include interior cleaning, routine upkeep and repairs to car bodies and safety features, ensuring regulatory compliance, facilitating wheelset replacements, performing interior blasting and lining, exterior painting, and applying car stenciling. Furthermore, GATX's activities extend to leasing aircraft spare engines (including units it directly owns) and managing a small collection of five liquefied gas-carrying vessels. The company also applies its expertise to overseeing asset portfolios on behalf of third parties. GATX maintains a substantial asset base, comprising approximately 147,000 railcars, a combined fleet of 568 locomotives (539 four-axle and 29 six-axle), and its five specialized vessels.","description_zh":"GATX Corporation（美股代碼：GATX）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Rental & Leasing Services 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"233 South Wacker Drive","city":"Chicago","state":"IL","zip":"60606-7147","country":"US","phone":"312 621 6200","full_address":"233 South Wacker Drive, Chicago, IL 60606-7147, US","range_52w":"150.69-205.56","year_high":205.56,"year_low":150.69,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":150.69,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-06","name":"Hillesland Kevin","title":"officer: SVP, Structured Finance","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1900,"price":77.07,"total_val":0.15},{"date":"2026-11-06","name":"Hillesland Kevin","title":"officer: SVP, Structured Finance","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":1400,"price":187.09,"total_val":0.26},{"date":"2026-11-06","name":"Hillesland Kevin","title":"officer: SVP, Structured Finance","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":500,"price":187.75,"total_val":0.09},{"date":"2026-11-06","name":"Hillesland Kevin","title":"officer: SVP, Structured Finance","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1900,"price":77.07,"total_val":0.15},{"date":"2026-11-05","name":"LYONS ROBERT C","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":18200,"price":77.07,"total_val":1.4},{"date":"2026-11-05","name":"LYONS ROBERT C","title":"director, officer: President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":4839,"price":185.44,"total_val"